This repository holds code under several sets of terms.

The Dreamcast port's code (src/, wadtool/, Makefile.dc, README.dreamcast.md),
from https://github.com/jnmartin84/doom64-dc, itself built on Erick194's
DOOM64-RE (https://github.com/Erick194/DOOM64-RE) and Immorpher's Doom 64
XE / Merciless Edition. The Dreamcast port publishes no licence file for
src/; wadtool/ carries the GNU GPL v3 (wadtool/LICENSE). Those terms are
the upstream projects' and are not changed here.

MIT (below, Team Resurgent) -- the Xbox port's original work:

  * Platform/xbox/, except the KallistiOS code listed in NOTICE;
  * tools/xbox/, setup.py, build.bat, rxdk.project.json, Doom-64-DC-X.sln,
    Doom-64-DC-X.vcxproj, Doom-64-DC-X.vcxproj.filters, .gitignore,
    .gitattributes, LICENSE, NOTICE and README.md;
  * the Xbox port's changes marked XBOX: in the files under src/ and
    wadtool/.

KOS License (Platform/xbox/LICENSE.KOS) -- the KallistiOS code carried into
Platform/xbox/, listed in NOTICE.

The game itself is not covered by any of these. Doom 64 is still sold and
is active intellectual property. No ROM, IWAD, music, sound, texture or
other game data is in this repository, and none may be added to it:
building needs your own legally obtained copy, and the Dreamcast port's own
data is fetched from its repository at build time, for your own use.

